{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"Y\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big 判 X：X 的大块直接交代人物、想法和因果，逐屏串起来更完整；Y 只看高亮词时，S10、S13 等屏会缺少部分关键缘由。small、core 判 Y：Y 的小字更能补足情境、心理转折和前后关系，全曲也更持续地扣住亲密的幸福与无法保证它留存的痛楚；X 在 S06-S07 的感官、情欲描写有些重复，容易让核心偏向感官体验。concise 判 X：Y 在 S11 的自我接纳、S12 的高兴与不再收着、S13 的担忧与退不回去等地方有意思重复和展开过度；human 判 Y：X 有‘挨着耳语’‘对生的眷恋’‘气味体感混着……’等搭配生硬、名词堆叠的问题，Y 虽有‘露出在意’‘忘了藏好喜欢’等局部别扭表达，整体语言衔接仍较自然。fine 判 X：X 的感受更多落在观众身体、亲近、犹豫和舍不得的具体体验上，Y 有较多感受转去描写声部、音符和歌声本身。load 判 Y：Y 的高亮块虽然略多，但每块明显更短，总体大字量少，切分也较容易扫读，和各屏停留时间更相称。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "86f128f7-0584-4579-9710-431aeccafe8c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T193543266726Z", "elapsed_seconds": 442.219, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T19:43:05.498203+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "281836e721505a0fb797723dae423a87af2e835b79447d2bd115f7fa7841cb00", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\ch